+- Implementation HEAD is
+  `043b587ef87850cc914262caa1dbc53227996c32`; its tree is
+  `9666a6c26d27808b32176ed2fdbe9a09d9e1102e`.
+- The production schema loader applied 16 migration files, 147/147 statements,
+  and 103 compatibility statements twice. Runtime readback reports 86 tables,
+  33 prepare columns, four indexes, all three CHECK clauses, and table status
+  `OK`.
+- Post-test readback reports zero prepare, stream, event, execution slot,
+  outcome, and all `c0-*` source/job/vector/chat rows. All five coordination
+  tables report `CHECK TABLE ... OK`.
+- Production source search finds no host-prepare caller, and the linked backend
+  contains zero host-prepare method symbols. This is non-reachability evidence,
+  not product support evidence.
+- The isolated runtime remains the checksum-verified unmodified 4.3.1 package;
