+
+## C0-D verdict
+
+The MariaDB **durable prepare registry store primitive** is suitable as the
+P1-4 base for later product slices. This does not close P1-4 at product level:
+authenticated transport, actual provider ownership, startup reconciliation,
+typed context/result validation, Node disposition CAS, known-failure retry,
+retention/expiry, joined terminal status, multi-stream policy, and patched
+process restart remain explicit gates.
